      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Cloud SQL Query Insights (top queries, execution plans, lock waits) is a **console-only** surface \u2014 Cloud Monitoring exports aggregate CPU/memory/disk/connections but not per-query plan detail, so it cannot be a Grafana panel. Open it directly: https://console.cloud.google.com/sql/instances/goatos-stg-core-db/insights?project=goatos-stg. `insights_config` is enabled by `infra/envs/stg/cloud_sql.tf`."
